"info":"0.1 Getting to know this Service Manual ",
  "text":"0.1 Getting to know this Service Manual This manual is used as the standard service manual for the IOT option - Finisher D6 Group configuration.[Finisher D6 Group Configuration Options]NoFunction ModuleOption Name (FB)Option Name (FBAP/WW)1CDM 770Interface Decurler D1 (770mm)Interface Decurler Module D1 (770mm)2CDM 560Interface Decurler D1 (560mm)Interface Decurler Module D1 (560mm)3IPInterposer D1Inserter D14HCSHigh Capacity Stacker 1/High Capacity Stacker 2High Capacity Stacker 1/High Capacity Stacker 25TCBMCrease/Two-sided Trimmer D1Crease/Two-sided Trimmer D16TCBMCrease/Two-sided Trimmer D2Crease/Two-sided Trimmer D27TBM-Two-sided Trimmer D18FolderFolder Unit CD2Folder Unit CD29Finisher D6Finisher D6Finisher D6Finisher D6 with Booklet MakerFinisher D6 with Booklet MakerFinisher D6 PlusFinisher D6 Plus10TSQFSquare Back Fold Trimmer D1Square Back Fold Trimmer D111IFMInterface Module D1Interface Module D112SEMStatic Eliminator D1Static Eliminator D113EDIMHigh Capacity Stacker A1 with Transport ModuleEDIM (High Capacity Stacker A1 with Transort Module)14SMGSmart Monitoring Gate D1Smart Monitoring Gate D1Furthermore, when this option is introduced to the market as an option for other IOTs, any unique information will be detailed as a compilation in this manual and released as a revision.Manual Revision HistoryNoVersionReason for Issue/RevisionPDF SettingsEdoc1V1.0V1.0Newly issued with the World Wide Support2V1.1V1.1Minor corrections3V1.2V1.2Revised with the introduction of Apeos 7580/6580/55804V1.3-Revised with the introduction of SMG5V1.4V1.4Revised with the introduction of Revoria Press EC1100/SC180/SC1706V1.5V1.5Updated with World Wide Revision"
