  "text":"6.2.7.7 Finisher D6 Supported Paper (Standard Paper) The following defines/guarantees the reliability and paper running capability of Finisher D6 for Standard paper/general paper.Restrictions may be applied to some Standard paper and general paper, etc. in a specific condition.Standard Paper/Supported Paper of Finisher D6 GroupRegionPaper BrandRevoria Press PC1120Revoria Press E1136GFBP Paper/Bond PPC Paper (64 gsm) -Standard PaperC2 (70gsm)General paperStandard PaperC2r (70gsm)General paper-EP (65gsm)-Standard PaperJ Paper (82 gsm)Standard PaperStandard PaperOS Coat W (127 gsm)Standard PaperRestricted PaperFBAP/WWCLR_TCH Plus (90gsm)--CLR_TCH Plus Gloss Coat (120gsm)--J Paper (82gsm)--OS Coat W(127gsm)--Color Xpressions Select (90gsm)Standard Paper-Digital Color Elite Gloss (120gsm)Standard Paper-Digital Color Elite Gloss (210gsm)Standard Paper-P Paper (64 gsm)-Standard PaperFBKR- X (75gsm)-Standard PaperC2-Standard Paper"
