"info":"REP 47.29.1 Bypass Chute Assembly ",
  "text":"REP 47.29.1 Bypass Chute Assembly Reference PL:PL 47.29Removal Perform the Power OFF procedure at the IOT. Check that the power is OFF and unplug the Power Plug.Remove the TCBM SW/LED PWB Assembly. (REP 47.5.1)Remove the Bypass Flapper Solenoid Assembly. (Figure 1)Remove the screw (x2).Release the clamp (x4) and remove the harness.Disconnect the connector.Remove the Bypass Flapper Solenoid Assembly.(Figure 1) tc447040Remove the Crease Inner Cover. (PL 47.1)Remove the J Chute Assembly. (REP 47.24.1)Remove the Bypass Chute Assembly. (Figure 2) Remove the screw (x4).Remove the Upper Exit Bypass Chute and Bypass Chute Bracket.(Figure 2) tcw447092Remove the TCB Exit Motor Assembly. (PL 47.30)Loosen the Belt (TCB Exit Motor). (PL 47.30)Remove the screw (x2) at the rear.Remove the Pulley (x2). (Figure 3)(Figure 3) tc447222Remove the screw (x2). (Figure 4)(Figure 4) tc447223Remove the Bypass Chute Assembly.Remove the screw (x2), and remove the Latch Guide for the J Chute Assembly. (Figure 5)(Figure 5) tcw447093Remove the screw (x2). (Figure 6)(Figure 6) tcw447094Remove the Bypass Chute Assembly. (PL 47.29)"
