"info":"REP 27.25.1 Booklet Transport Assembly ",
  "text":"REP 27.25.1 Booklet Transport Assembly Reference PL:PL 27.25Removal Perform the Power OFF procedure at the IOT. Check that the power is OFF and unplug the Power Plug.Open the Front Cover.Pull out the Booklet Transport Assembly until it can go no further.Remove the Upper Stopper Bracket. (PL 27.25) (Figure 1)Remove the screw.Remove the Upper Stopper Bracket. (PL 27.25)(Figure 1) ff427139Pull out the Booklet Transport Assembly to a position where the harness connector is visible. (Figure 2)Remove the hook of the Left Rail Assembly (PL 27.25). (Also remove the hook of the Right Rail Assembly (PL 27.25) at the opposite side)Be careful to not pull out the harness.(Figure 2) ffw427033Disconnect the harness connector (x5) of Booklet Transport Assembly. (Figure 3)(Figure 3) ff427188Remove the Booklet Transport Assembly."
