  "text":"049-237 Rear Tamper Home Sensor Off Fail Reference BSD:CH29.24The Rear Tamper Home Sensor did not change from ON to OFF (the Home position movement operation is not complete) within the specified time after moving to the Home position started.Cause/Action049-236 Refer to FIP."
