"info":"149-113 Stacker Path Sensor On Jam ",
  "text":"149-113 Stacker Path Sensor On Jam Reference BSD:CH29.6, CH29.10, CH29.11The Stacker Path Sensor did not turn ON within the specified time after the HCS 1 Bypass Exit Sensor ON.Initial ActionThe Fault Code and Component Code (DC330) of HCS1, HCS2 is 049-xxx for HCS1 and 149-xxx for HCS2. Perform operation after checking the No. of HCS.Cause/ActionCheck the following:The Stacker Path Sensor (DC330 [149-105]) for operation failure. (PL 39.16)The HCS Transport Motor 2 (DC330 [049-042]) for operation failure. (PL 39.7)The Bypass Clutch 3 (DC330 [049-038]) for operation failure. (PL 39.12)It is possible to drive the Bypass Exit Roll by combining this with the HCS Transport Motor 2 (DC330 [049-042]).The Bypass Exit Roll and Pinch Roll for transportation failure due to contamination, wear, and deterioration.The HCS 1 and the HCS 2 for improper docking.The Drive Belt for disengagement, deterioration, and improper tension.The Drive Gear for wear and damage.A paper transportation failure due to foreign substances on the paper path.Usage of out of spec paper.If no problem is found, replace the following parts in sequence: However, each time a parts is replaced, check whether the Fail is still occurring and return the part if it has no problems.HCS PWB (PL 39.37)HCS Drive PWB (PL 39.37)"
