  "text":"6.2.1.2 CDM, IFM Dimension and Weight Device Size (CDM770/CDM560)Device Size: 340 (*1)x724.3x991.5 (*2) (WxDxH mm)*1: Excluding the electrical ground with the IOT, gaskets (9 mm), some screw heads (within 3 mm), and partial tag of the chute (within 3 mm).*2: The height must be kept within 991.5 +/-3 mm by adjusting the casters.(Figure 1) cd621001Device Size (IFM)Device Size: 165 (*1)x724.3x991.5 (*2) (WxDxH mm)*1: Excluding the electrical ground with the IOT, gaskets (9 mm), some screw heads (within 3 mm), and partial tag of the chute (within 3 mm).*2: The height must be kept within 991.5 +/-3 mm by adjusting the casters.(Figure 2) ifm620001Device WeightCDM770: 40 kg or lighterCDM560: 40 kg or lighterIFM: 25 kg or lighter"
