"href":"contents/m002021051317202400129cb3.html",
"info":"149-113 Stacker Path Sensor On Jam ",
  "text":"149-113 Stacker Path Sensor On Jam Reference BSD:CH32.8The Stacker Path Sensor did not turn ON within the specified time after Bypass Exit Sensor ON.Initial ActionThe 1st 3-digit (x of x49-) of the Fault Code and Component Code for HCS is 0, for HCS and EDIM combination is 1. Perform operation after checking the EDIM is installed.Cause/ActionCheck the following:The Stacker Path Sensor (DC330 [149-105]) for operation failure. (PL 74.16)The EDIM Transport Motor 2 (DC330 [049-042]) for operation failure. (PL 74.7)The Bypass Clutch 3 (DC330 [049-038]) for operation failure. (PL 74.12)It is possible to drive the Bypass Exit Roll by combining this with the EDIM Transport Motor 2 (DC330 [049-042]).The Bypass Exit Roll and Pinch Roll for transportation failure due to contamination, wear, and deterioration.The Drive Belt for disengagement, deterioration, and improper tension.The Drive Gear for wear and damage.Paper transport failure due to foreign matter on the paper path.Usage of out of spec paper.If no problem is found, replace the following parts in sequence. However, each time a parts is replaced, check whether the Fail is still occurring and return the part if it has no problems.EDIM PWB (PL 74.37)EDIM Drive PWB (PL 74.37)"
