  "text":"9.1.9.5 Installation of Finisher Tray Extension Kit Product OverviewStores Long paper [416.7 mm to 487.7 mm (19.2 inch)] flatly on the Stacker Tray.Product Code:Finisher Tray Extension Kit: ED200996ED201268 [Apeos C8180G,ApeosPro C810G,Revoria Press PC1120, Revoria Press E1136G, Revoria Press EC1100, Revoria Press SC180G]Installation ProcedureOpen and check the bundled items.No.NameQty1Add Tray Assembly12Installation Manual1Install the Add Tray Assembly to the Stacker Tray. (Figure 1) Insert the bracket tab into the D hole (x2) of the rib.(Figure 1) ff910032"
