  "text":"9.1.11.1 Installation of High Capacity Stacker Extension Kit Product CodeHigh Capacity Stacker Extension Kit: ED201262 [ApeosPro C810G, Revoria Press PC1120, Revoria Press EC1100, Revoria Press SC180G]Installation ProcedureOpen the package and check the Bundled Items.High Capacity Stacker Extension Kit bundled items (Figure 1, Figure 2)No.NameQty1Top Tray12Base Assembly13Tray Assembly14Extension Wire Tray25Wire Holder26Corrugation Wire Tray27Tray Spring18Screw(M3x6)79Screw(M4x12)210Screw(M3x7)411Holder Bracket Assembly112Corrugation Wire Rack Bracket113Wire Holder114Inst Label1(Figure 1) sa910013(Figure 2) sa910014Install the HCS. (9.1.6.1)Remove the HCS Top Cover. (REP 39.2a.1)Remove the HCS Top Tray. (Figure 3)Remove the screw (M3x6:x2).Remove the HCS Top Tray.(Figure 3) saw910011Install the Long Paper Top Tray. (Figure 4)Install the Long Paper Top Tray.Secure it with the screw (M3x6: x2) provided in the High Capacity Stacker Extension Kit.(Figure 4) saw910012Install the HCS Top Cover. (Figure 5)Install the HCS Top Cover.Secure it with screw (M3x6: x3).(Figure 5) saw910013Close the Upper Cover.Install the Base. (Figure 6)Install the Base.Secure it with the screw (M3x6: x3) provided in the High Capacity Stacker Extension Kit.(Figure 6) saw910014Install the Long Paper Tray. (Figure 7)Install the Long Paper Tray.Secure it with the screw (M3x6: x2) provided in the High Capacity Stacker Extension Kit.(Figure 7) saw910015Attach the Corrugation Wire/Spring Wire. (Figure 8)Attach the Corrugation Wire/Spring Wire.(Figure 8) saw910016Adjust the pitch width of the Corrugation Wire according to the use.If not compatible with Lightweight paper, attach the wire. (Figure 9)(Figure 9) saw910017[When there is no downstream device]: Proceed to Step 13.[When there is downstream device]: Proceed to Step 14.Install the Wire Holder (x2). (Figure 10)Remove the HCS Light Cover screw (M4x8: x2).Install the bracket.Secure it with the screw (M4x12: x2) provided in the HCS Top Tray Extension Kit.Install the Wire Holder (x2).Secure it with the screw (M3x7: x4) provided in the HCS Top Tray Extension Kit.(Figure 10) sa910028If the wires are not used, it can be stored as shown in the figure. (Figure 11)(Figure 11) saw910018Remove the Finisher Rear Upper Cover. (Figure 12)Remove the screw (x4).Remove the Finisher Rear Upper Cover.(Figure 12) ff910025Hook the Holder Bracket and the Wire Holder on the rib of the Rear Lower Cover to secure it. (Figure 13)(Figure 13) sa910030Store the wires as shown in the figure. (Figure 14)(Figure 14) sa910031When not using the Holder Bracket and Wire Holder, store the wires on the HCS Top Cover. (Figure 15)(Figure 15) sa910027Install the Finisher Rear Upper Cover."
