"info":"064-332 ILS AGOC Fail ET ",
  "text":"064-332 ILS AGOC Fail ET Reference BSD:CH70.11An error was detected during Gain adjustment (Entrance side).Cause/ActionTurn OFF the power, and check the Flat Cable between the ILS CCD PWB (Entrance) J700ET and the ILS DC Power PWB J8 for open circuit, short circuit, or poor contact.If the problem persists, replace the ILS DC Power PWB. (PL 76.9)"
